Usage:
  web [OPTIONS] admin login-code [login-code-OPTIONS]

Print a fresh login code for the account's open login attempt, for when mail is
down.

Help Options:
  -h, --help                            Show this help message

[login-code command options]
          --email=                      Email of the account to issue a login
                                        code for
          --session-salt=               Salt for session cookies and hashed
                                        values [$SESSION_SALT]

    Database:
          --database-url=               Postgres connection URL [$DATABASE_URL]

    Login:
          --login-code-lifetime=        How long a mailed login code works
                                        (default: 15m) [$LOGIN_CODE_LIFETIME]
          --login-code-tries=           Wrong codes one login attempt allows
                                        (default: 5) [$LOGIN_CODE_TRIES]
          --login-codes-mailed=         Login codes mailed to one user per
                                        --login-codes-mailed-window (default:
                                        3) [$LOGIN_CODES_MAILED]
          --login-codes-mailed-window=  Window of --login-codes-mailed
                                        (default: 15m)
                                        [$LOGIN_CODES_MAILED_WINDOW]
          --login-wrong-tries=          Wrong codes on one user's attempts per
                                        --login-wrong-tries-window before no
                                        code logs them in (default: 10)
                                        [$LOGIN_WRONG_TRIES]
          --login-wrong-tries-window=   Window of --login-wrong-tries (default:
                                        1h) [$LOGIN_WRONG_TRIES_WINDOW]
          --login-unconfirmed-lifetime= How long an account nobody confirmed
                                        with a code is kept (default: 24h)
                                        [$LOGIN_UNCONFIRMED_LIFETIME]
          --login-prune-every=          How often old login attempts and
                                        unconfirmed accounts are deleted
                                        (default: 1h) [$LOGIN_PRUNE_EVERY]
